======================================================================
2. Host-provided packages (NOT redistributed)
======================================================================

The WorkBuddy / CodeBuddy Code host provides no import map for this connector,
so nothing is external: React, React DOM and the MCP App SDK are bundled into
the panel and widget output and are listed in section 1. The Kiro Crew version
of this project keeps those as host externals; that host is not part of this
repository.

